{"seq":3,"slug":"series-residues","title":"级数与留数","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/series-residues","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"taylor-laurent","title":"泰勒与洛朗级数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/series-residues/taylor-laurent","wordCount":1484,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"singularities-residues","title":"奇点与留数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/series-residues/singularities-residues","wordCount":1402,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"residue-theorem","title":"留数定理与应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/series-residues/residue-theorem","wordCount":1449,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"级数与留数\">级数与留数</h1><p>前两章证明了解析函数无穷可导、且其内部值被边界完全决定。本章把这两条事实推到它们的自然结论：解析函数必然展成幂级数，而当函数带奇点时，展开里多出的负幂项会浓缩出一个叫「留数」的数，进而把所有围道积分化成一道加法题。</p>\n<p>第一节讲泰勒与洛朗级数。解析函数在解析点展成只有正幂的泰勒级数，收敛半径恰好等于到最近奇点的距离——这个复数视角解释了许多实分析里看不懂的收敛现象。当函数在某点有孤立奇点时，改用允许负幂的洛朗级数，其负幂部分（主部）刻画奇点的强弱，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(z-z_0)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是绕圈积分中唯一幸存的项。</p>\n<p>第二节给这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 正名为留数，并按主部形态把孤立奇点分成可去、极点、本性三类。针对最常用的极点，给出一整套无需展开级数就能算留数的快捷公式，让计算变成机械操作。</p>\n<p>第三节是高潮——留数定理：绕复杂围道一周的积分，等于内部所有留数之和乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>。它把积分问题彻底代数化，更反过来攻克大量用实变量方法束手无策的实积分，给出三类经典套路。</p>\n<p>本章把积分提炼成了留数代数。下一章会看到，这套语言连同共形映射，正是复分析走向物理工程与现代数学猜想的通行证。</p>\n"}